  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"acTZd\" id=\"acTZd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub6cdcc27\" id=\"ub6cdcc27\">学习目标</span></h2><ul list=\"u294ca4e4\"><li fid=\"u51a20283\" data-lake-id=\"ue9466ef0\" id=\"ue9466ef0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3aceb8ac\" id=\"u3aceb8ac\">理解裸机多任务的基本概念和特点。</span></li><li fid=\"u51a20283\" data-lake-id=\"u43b43a1f\" id=\"u43b43a1f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua478ec23\" id=\"ua478ec23\">掌握如何通过中断计时替代传统的 delay 函数，避免阻塞式延时。</span></li><li fid=\"u51a20283\" data-lake-id=\"u76ee9ef8\" id=\"u76ee9ef8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c82f62f\" id=\"u6c82f62f\">学习如何在全局中使用唯一的主 while 死循环进行任务调度。</span></li><li fid=\"u51a20283\" data-lake-id=\"ucec7acfe\" id=\"ucec7acfe\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua7964592\" id=\"ua7964592\">通过流水灯和按键案例，理解任务分解与调度的基本原理。</span></li><li fid=\"u51a20283\" data-lake-id=\"u7648428b\" id=\"u7648428b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5bc31493\" id=\"u5bc31493\">泛化出一个裸机多任务框架的雏形，为后续复杂任务调度打下基础。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"a8XqQ\" id=\"a8XqQ\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua41a6df8\" id=\"ua41a6df8\">学习内容</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"XA5n9\" id=\"XA5n9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u338d695c\" id=\"u338d695c\">时间切片</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u2feb19fa\" id=\"u2feb19fa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6988aa86\" id=\"u6988aa86\">时间切片是指将 CPU 的执行时间划分为多个固定长度的时间段（称为“时间片”），每个时间段分配给不同的任务轮流执行。通过快速切换任务，从宏观上看，多个任务似乎是同时运行的，但实际上它们是在微观上交替执行的。</span></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"cVPvo\" id=\"cVPvo\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6e916f88\" id=\"u6e916f88\">代码体现</span></h4><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%88%87%E7%89%87%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%9A%E6%97%B6%E5%99%A8%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%5Cnlib_timer_init()%3B%5Cn%5Cn......%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%9A%E6%97%B6%E5%99%A8%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%5Cnvoid%20lib_timer6_on_interrupt()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%201ms%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%5Cn%20%20%20%20count%2B%2B%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%88%87%E7%89%87%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DFmVb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"ua6d4cddf\"><li fid=\"ub364b51f\" data-lake-id=\"u5d43c8df\" id=\"u5d43c8df\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8a0f05c9\" id=\"u8a0f05c9\">将定时器设置为 1秒钟执行1000次，也就是对1秒钟进行切片1000次，1个时间片就是1ms。</span></li><li fid=\"ub364b51f\" data-lake-id=\"ue3934212\" id=\"ue3934212\"><span data-lake-id=\"u639e40b8\" id=\"u639e40b8\">切片的1ms就是最小时间粒度。</span></li><li fid=\"ub364b51f\" data-lake-id=\"u83e95c92\" id=\"u83e95c92\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue41c2574\" id=\"ue41c2574\">每次中断进行计数，就可以得到全局的时间计数。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"JbByL\" id=\"JbByL\"><span data-lake-id=\"u61b2c8d5\" id=\"u61b2c8d5\">分时调用</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"udacaf67c\" id=\"udacaf67c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u407f27c3\" id=\"u407f27c3\">分时调用是指在一个单核处理器上，通过时间分割的方式，让多个任务轮流占用 CPU 的执行时间。每个任务只执行一小段时间后主动交出控制权，等待下一次被调用。通过这种机制，多个任务可以共享 CPU 资源，从而实现并发效果。</span></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"I9iHG\" id=\"I9iHG\"><span data-lake-id=\"u58ba851b\" id=\"u58ba851b\">代码体现</span></h4><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E5%88%86%E6%97%B6%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22if(count%20%25%20500%20%3D%3D%200)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20led_logic()%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E5%88%86%E6%97%B6%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YLcsN%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u15e82bd5\"><li fid=\"uc5abafa9\" data-lake-id=\"u9d521bfd\" id=\"u9d521bfd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3658ce87\" id=\"u3658ce87\">全局时间进行拆分</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E5%88%87%E7%89%87%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20led_logic()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20static%20uint8_t%20i%20%3D%200%3B%5Ct%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(i%20%3D%3D%200)%20leds_on(0)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(i%20%3D%3D%201)%20leds_on(1)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(i%20%3D%3D%202)%20leds_on(2)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(i%20%3D%3D%203)%20leds_on(3)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(i%20%3D%3D%204)%20leds_on(4)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(i%20%3D%3D%205)%20leds_on(5)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(i%20%3D%3D%206)%20leds_on(6)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(i%20%3D%3D%207)%20leds_on(7)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(i%20%3D%3D%208)%20leds_off_all()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20i%2B%2B%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(i%20%3E%208)%20i%20%3D%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E5%88%87%E7%89%87%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u9Xy0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue78da6c3\" id=\"ue78da6c3\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data: